@startuml
!theme sunlust
participant Client
participant "element:\nConcreteElementA" as Element
participant "visitor:\nConcreteVisitor1" as Visitor

Client -> Element: accept(visitor)
activate Element

Element -> Visitor: visitConcreteElementA(this)
activate Visitor

note right of Visitor
    Now visitor knows:
    1. Which operation (Visitor1)
    2. Which element type (ElementA)
    
    Can perform operation
    specific to both!
end note

Visitor -> Element: getData()
Element --> Visitor: data

Visitor -> Visitor: process data
Visitor --> Element: done
deactivate Visitor

Element --> Client: done
deactivate Element
@enduml